# OMS Specification Vol. 2 Annex N, Release E (2023-12), N.13: electricity meter, SND-NR
# with an inverse compact profile (Annex R), type M base time, mode 7 with AFL CMAC.
# https://oms-group.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Open-Metering-System-Specification_Annex-N.pdf
# format A with link-layer CRCs, as printed in the specification
format a
key 000102030405060708090A0B0C0D0E0F

= wireless C 44 OMG 12345678 electricity v1
= authenticated
= energy — 1.9960 kWh
= energy · backward — 305.1 Wh
= date and time · storage 3 — 3 s before reception
= energy · storage 3 — 1.995 kWh
= energy · compact profile · storage 3 — 46 increments, every 8 s, backwards
= energy · backward · storage 3 — 305 Wh
= energy · backward · compact profile · storage 3 — 46 increments, every 8 s, backwards
= actuality duration · storage 3 — 3 s
= error flags · standard conformant — 0
